                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Copy of Telegram From Admiralty to C. G. W/T Rosyth
                        and C-in-C., G.</hi>[<hi rendition="#italic">F</hi>.]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-01-23">23. 1. 19</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>ANAC to C-in-C, German H.S.F. for Admiral Goette.</p>
                <p>Report by W/T details steps that are now being taken to carry out Article XXII.
                    of Terms of Armistice as amended on 16 January.</p>
                <p rendition="#right">(1220)</p>
            </div>
